#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073445 :question/id #uuid "e9aae52c-65f3-5dff-bc6b-a530f8c7acc1" :question/math-academy-id "e-13009" :question/problem "Solve the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y &=4 \\\\ x+2y &=16\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We will isolate a variable in one of the equations and then substitute it into the other equation. It doesn't matter which equation we pick first, so we choose the easiest one. In this case, the first equation looks like the easiest.\n\nUsing the first equation, we can isolate $x$ by adding $y$ to both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-y & =4 \\\\ x & =4+y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we replace $x$ with $4+y$ in the second equation and solve for $y\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\tx+2y &=16 \\\\\n\t(4+y) + 2y &=16\\\\\n\t4+3y &=16\\\\\n\t3y &=12\\\\\n\ty &=4\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we now substitute $y=4$ into $x=4+y$, then we can find the value of $x\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\tx &= 4 + y \\\\\n\t   &= 4 + (4) \\\\\n\t   &=8\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $x = 8$ and $y = 4$, which can be written as $(8, 4).$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073446 :question/id #uuid "707504e8-a367-5dc2-a663-371a9dcf7224" :question/math-academy-id "e-13010" :question/problem "Solve the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2u+9v-6 &=0 \\\\ 2u+6v-8 &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Sometimes, it's handy to assign a number to each equation in a system, so that we can refer to them more easily:\n\n\n$$\n\\qquad\\:\\:\\: \\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{\\color{red}2u+9v-6} &{\\color{red}{}=0} && {\\color{red}(1)} \\\\ {\\color{blue}2u+6v-8} &{\\color{blue}{}=0} && {\\color{blue}(2)}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n\n\nWe will isolate a variable in one of the equations and then substitute it into the other equation. Using equation $\\color{blue}(2)$, we can solve for $u$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\t2u+6v-8 &= 0 \\\\\n2u+6v &= 8 \\\\\n2u &= 8 - 6v \\\\\nu &= \\dfrac{8-6v}{2} \\\\\nu &= 4 - 3v\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $u=4-3v$ into equation $\\color{red}(1)$ and solve for $v\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\t2u+9v-6 &= 0 \\\\\n\t2(4-3v)+9v-6 &= 0 \\\\\n\t8-6v+9v-6 &= 0 \\\\\n2+3v &= 0 \\\\\n3v &= -2 \\\\\nv &= -\\dfrac{2}{3}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we now substitute $v=-\\dfrac{2}{3}$ into equation $\\color{red}(1)$, then we can find the value of $u\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\t2u+9v-6 &= 0 \\\\\n\t2u+9\\left(-\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right) -6 &= 0 \\\\\n\t2u-6-6 &= 0 \\\\\n\t2u-12 &= 0 \\\\\n\t2u &= 12 \\\\\n\tu &= 6\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $u=6$ and $v=-\\dfrac{2}{3}$, which can be written as $\\left(6,-\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right).$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073997 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a72bb5e1-600c-5bc3-9a20-8a9139d96608" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "p = 4, q = 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070068} {:answer/id #uuid "db48f86d-2fc7-507b-bdea-a2a005a0b680" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "p = 4, q =-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070069} {:answer/id #uuid "02252a99-76f0-5313-9df0-f9ec9acc8c20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "p = 4, q = 3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070070} {:answer/id #uuid "3b9ad275-7db8-59c8-8912-f40f971d2f8f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "p = 3, q = 4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070071} {:answer/id #uuid "6285edaa-20b3-59cd-9749-0f49e5e95580" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "p =-4, q = 3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070072}] :answer-field/id #uuid "76642104-cdd8-5320-bbe7-97e833212d5e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070067}] :question/id #uuid "833a2ed3-b37f-5ade-bd6a-5fdaf64b6506" :question/math-academy-id "q-12444" :question/problem "Using the method of substitution, find the solution of\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3p + q &=-9 \\\\ 5p + 4q &=32\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073998 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "840a66d8-a769-5b7d-9b3e-56e75696fb72" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a =-4, b = 4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070074} {:answer/id #uuid "885a205a-2ea2-543d-94ad-dd8f41804a39" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 3, b =-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070075} {:answer/id #uuid "8b98aa0f-2e3d-5c66-a1e2-83fb7ee036b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 4, b =-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070076} {:answer/id #uuid "b1e7e93a-adf5-514b-a6ad-8218c526bbc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a = 2, b =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070077} {:answer/id #uuid "1cacef46-ef5e-5b1b-814c-14b3f44ea4fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a =-2, b = 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070078}] :answer-field/id #uuid "3f914bec-7e6e-58f8-a49c-484a6a89ef3a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070073}] :question/id #uuid "90bf8b55-699c-5e18-b484-90473cb6a72f" :question/math-academy-id "q-12457" :question/problem "Using the method of substitution, find the solution of\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-7a + 2b &=18 \\\\ -6a + 6b &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186074030 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/id #uuid "c3a49164-4f9d-597a-9dc6-abf7860aa4ba" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070261} {:answer-field/id #uuid "795f6bc6-c4b4-5520-883c-77f20cec08ce" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070262}] :question/id #uuid "acc0a44e-6eb6-5a95-a139-3841ec88693b" :question/math-academy-id "q-171690" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations:\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x + 5y &=13 \\\\ y &=x + 5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\nFind the solution $(x, y)$ to this system using the method of substitution.\n\nThe solution is\n$($ {{field-1}} $,$ {{field-2}} $)$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186074047 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "108d90bc-6b5c-5888-a441-c0910faf7b57" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070290} {:answer/id #uuid "3afa1d5f-dfe6-59bc-8683-638f0716320d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "26" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070291} {:answer/id #uuid "5b963b53-bada-5f5f-9e14-bb49282b0719" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070292} {:answer/id #uuid "637fb8f3-b4ed-5b3b-b5dc-ae08c01f9ce3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070293} {:answer/id #uuid "71ce6b5e-047a-5e92-8750-073b719123cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070294}] :answer-field/id #uuid "8b1211a7-7190-520c-ac4c-581ede5f3f0f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186070289}] :questi